      </header>

      <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>The Divemaster course is your first step into a professional diving career. It’s a challenging and transformative experience that shifts your focus from your own diving to the safety and enjoyment of others. Bali, with its incredible biodiversity, varied dive conditions, and thriving dive community, offers an unparalleled environment to earn this prestigious rating. Here, we skip the fluff and give you the field-tested advice you need to succeed.</p>

        <h3 class="text-gold"><i class="fa-solid fa-star-of-life mr-2"></i>Key Takeaways for Your Training</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
