        </button>
        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">Most Divemaster internships in Bali range from 4 to 12 weeks. A longer duration allows for more hands-on experience with a wider variety of courses and dive conditions, making you a more confident and employable professional.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 bg-white/5">
